{title: Ancient of Days}
{artist: William Croswell Doane & J. Albert Jeffery}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[Bb]Ancient of Days, who [Eb]sittest throned in [Bb]glory,
to [Cm]thee all knees are [F]bent, all voices [Bb]pray;
thy love has blessed the [Eb]wide world's wondrous [Bb]story
with [Cm]light and life since [F]Eden's dawning [Bb]day.
